# -*- coding: utf-8 -*-
LONG = {
"VOODOO": """VOODOO is a mystic synthesizer built on physical and modal modeling, with no samples. Eight engines cover wind, plucked, bowed-style and vocal colours: Flute, Pan Flute, Shakuhachi (breath noise plus waveguide), Sitar, Oud (Karplus-Strong with jawari buzz and sympathetic strings), Kalimba (inharmonic modes), Erhu and Voodoo Choir (saws with formants). Five timbre controls reshape each engine (breath/vowel, body/resonance, brightness, width/detune, texture). The LFO routes to pitch, filter, amplitude or timbre; the effects section adds reverb, chorus, distortion and a ping-pong delay. 12 voices, mono/poly, glide, pitch-bend and mod wheels (CC1). 70 factory presets in 7 banks of 10; user presets save as .voodoopreset. Resizable interface. VST3 and standalone.""",
"WARZONE808": """WARZONE808 is an 808 and bass synthesizer for trap, hip-hop and bass music. PolyBLEP oscillators feed a TPT filter with its own envelope (depth and A/D/S) and velocity sensitivity; unison goes up to 7 voices with adjustable detune; mono mode has legato glide and falls back to the note still held. 16 voices, pitch range of ±12 semitones, reverb, chorus, distortion and delay. 70 presets: 808 Subs, Dirty & Reese, Leads, Plucks & Keys, Pads & Ambience, FX & Percussion, plus the Expansion Vol.1 pack (10 presets). The EXPANSION cassette loads additional .wz808exp packs. User presets save as .wz808preset. Resizable interface. VST3 and standalone.""",
"FUNKYKOPS": """FUNKYKOPS is a funk, disco and G-Funk synthesizer without samples. Eight engines: Clavinet (Karplus-Strong with bite), Rhodes (tine and bell, velocity bark), Synth Bass, Brass, Strings, Lead, Guitar and Talkbox (saws with formants and vowels). Filter (LP/HP/BP) with envelope depth, decay, resonance and velocity sensitivity; vowel, body, bright, width and texture controls shape each engine. LFO with sources from Sine to Sample & Hold, glide, mono/poly, reverb, chorus, distortion and delay. 16 voices. 70 presets in 7 banks of 10: Clavinet & Funk Keys, Rhodes & EP, Synth Bass, Brass & Stabs, Strings & Disco, Leads & Talkbox, Guitar & FX. User presets save as .fkpreset. VST3 and standalone.""",
"OCCITANIE": """OCCITANIE is a synthesizer of Occitan and European folk instruments, built without samples. Eight engines: Cabrette (nasal reed with breath), Vielle (bowed strings with buzz), Galoubet (recorder flute), Mandoline (Karplus-Strong with tremolo), Guitare, Accordéon (three reeds with musette detune), Choir and Carillon (inharmonic modes). A DRONE layer an octave below can be added to any engine for bagpipe or hurdy-gurdy textures. Filter (LP/HP/BP), ADSR, reed/body/bright/drone/velocity controls, width and texture, LFO, glide, mono/poly, reverb, chorus, distortion and delay. 16 voices. 70 presets in 7 banks of 10 with Occitan names (Capitole Cabrette, Canal du Midi, Montségur...). User presets save as .occpreset. VST3 and standalone.""",
}
